her total daily energy intake among all group members.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.04257446673046459, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7094579917438509, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0002642465843836964, 'judge_prob_std': 0.31012556067984703}

