   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.2409702097531308, 'session_id': '473031ae-77ea-498d-a167-05600e54b373', 'judge_perplexity': 1.6063082414554843, 'prob_std': 0.22069588378907434, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.09349747632509192, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9659541/', 'https://www.cdc.gov/bmi/about/index.html', 'https://med.stanford.edu/news/insights/2024/11/bmi-body-mass-index-alternatives-science.html', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4224224/', 'https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/articles/9464-body-mass-index-bmi'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.8293386627388062, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "CORRECT", "score": 1.0, "reason": "The explanation asserts that Total Daily Energy Intake (TDEI) does not directly cause Body Mass Index (BMI) when mediating variables such as Total Daily Energy Expenditure (TDEE) are present. It reasons that the effect of TDEI on BMI is mediated through the energy balance (i.e., TDEI vs. TDEE), rather than through a direct causal path from intake to BMI. This line of reasoning is logically sound: in the presence of TDEE as a mediator, the direct link from TDEI to BMI would be redundant or misleading, as the mechanism is fully captured by the energy balance. The explanation correctly identifies that, in a causal model with TDEE included, the direct causal arrow from TDEI to BMI should be omitted to avoid conflating direct and mediated effects."}], "aggregate_score": 1.0, "aggregate_verdict": "CORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.6948244818840683, 'motivation': 'Total Daily Energy Intake (TDEI) does not directly cause Body Mass Index (BMI) in the presence of mediating variables like Total Daily Energy Expenditure (TDEE), which is included in the CLD. The effect of TDEI on BMI operates through the energy balance between intake and expenditure, so the direct causal link should not be included.', 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.010276351992865744, 'perplexity': 1.197778716374514, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8809912212422285, 'min_prob': 0.16834909446451227, 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7485586872736627, 'token_prob_slope': -0.002136364039386149, 'prob_variance': 0.048706673121440607, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.7066140477669307, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0010437621635692985, 'judge_prob_std': 0.30577357035082664, 'avg_nll': 0.18046877175941062}

